summary:
  Whatever ffmpeg heard is printed, however little it was.

history:
  Against sixty seconds, five seconds missed one station by 6.3 dB and ten
  by 3.1; twenty were within 1.3 on every one. A reading of less is not the
  number the rules rest on.

target:
  package/contents/ui/loudness.py

find:
      if heard(text) < seconds - SHORT_BY:

replace:
      if heard(text) < 0:

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_loudness.py::test_a_stream_that_ends_early_is_no_reading.
  Line-neutral.
